{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RP-03 retry-envelope validation checkpoint saved to .joe-janitor/rp03-retry-envelope-validation.md and summarized durably on rubellite-secondary-cub. Three read-only investigations covered past GitHub Actions logs, maintained Jira/other-ticket-system defaults, and current Rebar behavior. No Actions run was dispatched. The evidence supports 3 total wire calls and 15s cumulative inline sleep, with the fallback refined from 1/2s to 2/4s plus nonnegative jitter. Long Retry-After values defer; one observe/replan cycle shares the same budgets; readiness polling remains separate. Current logs provide only weak negative evidence because they lack physical-attempt telemetry, so that observability is now a required design element. No tracked files or RP-04 state changed."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787005890881988001,"uuid":"3d5291f8-cdb1-4788-aeda-588ddeab2822"}